# Three Paths (mission.cop.three_paths#nomission). A level 75 Warrior with no CoP mission current; a GM sets Tenzen 12
# (the path field only; no mission is current). Metalworks, Cid: event 500 (Metalworks DefaultActions); Tavnazian
# Safehold, Despachiaire: event 106 (Tavnazian Safehold DefaultActions).
lists Metalworks/Cid/onTrigger Metalworks/onEventFinish/851 Metalworks/onEventFinish/853 Metalworks/onEventFinish/854 TavnazianSafehold/Despachiaire/onTrigger TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/118
char zone=Metalworks pos=-12,-12,1 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
login
missionstatus Cop 12 pos=3              # a GM
trigger Cid
finish-if-event
warp 108,-40,-83 TavnazianSafehold
trigger Despachiaire
finish-if-event
